# CrisPRO.ai SAE Integration Audit Report

## 🎯 **EXECUTIVE SUMMARY**

**Current State:** SAE (Sparse Autoencoder) features are **buried** in the application - present in `src2` components but not prominently featured in the main application.

**Opportunity:** Transform existing components to showcase SAE as the **core differentiator** - "The only cancer genomics platform with mechanistically interpretable AI."

**Strategy:** Enhance existing components rather than create new ones, bringing SAE features to the forefront of every user interaction.

